              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The Tanzanian trainees were introduced to medieval and Islamic archaeology in Africa, rescue and salvage excavations, building archaeology and architectural heritage, ceramic drawing, laser scanning, GPS technology, photogrammetry, 3D modelling software, Geographic Information Systems and animation software.",
